     <P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">全校教师：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">为进一步推进我校名师队伍建设，调动和激发学校存量名师工作积极性，锻造学科领军人物，引领教师专业成长和学科团队发展，不断提升学校在课程建设与高考成绩、学科竞赛与创新人才培养、学科教学研究与实践等方面的实力，根据《绍兴市第一中学“英贤计划”项目方案》之《“杏坛英贤计划”项目实施方案》、《绍兴市第一中学“英贤教师岗位津贴”实施细则》和《绍兴市第一中学“英贤教师”选聘管理办法》，经学校评聘委员会研究决定，特设立绍兴一中“英贤教师岗位”，现就申报事项通知如下。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.05pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">一、申报对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">在校在职在岗的正高级教师与特级教师。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>能胜任本职工作，在学科领域内具有引领和影响辐射作用，身体健康，年龄原则上不超过</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>60</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">周岁。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.05pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">二、岗位性质<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>英贤教师</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">实行合同聘任制，坚持按需设岗、择优聘任、合同管理，实现设岗、选人和责权的有机统一，由学校教科室负责具体实施。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.05pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">三、岗位要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年度考核要求：每年度考核在合格及以上等次；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">工作量要求：每年度服从学校安排，满教育教学正常工作量。担任班主任工作，或教研组长工作，或竞赛辅导工作，或年级长工作，或行政处室管理工作等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">专业引领要求：所带班级教学成绩位于年段前三分之一；或有<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>篇教育教学论文在省级及以上刊物上发表；或主持<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>项市级及以上课题（含教改项目）；或开发<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>门市级及以上校本课程；或开设<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>节市级及以上公开课、观摩课、优质课；或主讲<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>次市级及以上教育教学类学术报告讲座（经验介绍）；或为主命制<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>份校级及以上重大考试（期中期末考试、校际联考、高考模拟考试或学校自主招生录取考试等）试卷，或所带学生学科竞赛获得省级一等奖及以上；或开设市直级以上名师工作室，指导工作室学员在教育教学等专业技能比赛中取得市直及以上奖项。（具备其中三项）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">援助青田中学要求：根据学校与青田中学的结对协议，按要求结对、带教和培养青田中学来校交流学习的教师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">完成学校安排的其他工作任务。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">四、岗位待遇<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">对符合条件获得聘任的英贤教师，学校与其签订为期五年（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>-2024</SPAN>年）的协议，每人每年度补贴最高上限为<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>万元的岗位津贴。岗位津贴在通过学校年度考核后，按每月<SPAN lang=EN-US>2.5</SPAN>万元发放。如遇退休、外调、离职等，以当年度实际在校时间计发岗位津贴。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">五、申报时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US>-12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoCommentText><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">六、申报所需材料<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">绍兴一中“英贤教师岗位”申报表（附后）；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">特级、正高的职称证书或文件（原件与复印件各一份）；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">表明教学能力和成绩的相关证明材料（原件与复印件各一份）；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
